  "wikitext": "{|class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;\"\n!Blueprint Requirements\n|-\n|1,000,000x [[steel]], 10,000x [[coal]]\n|}\n\nImproves all [[coal mine|coal mines]] of a [[corporation]] in the [[region]] it is installed in to produce 12x [[coal]] instead of 8x.\n\nThe u version makes it produce 16x [[coal]], and the uu version produces 80x [[coal]]. It is 5x more powerful to have a uu version versus u version. If you will produce coal for coal power plants, then rushing a uu is a must!\n\n[[Category:Asset]]\n[[Category:Technology]]",
